tps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vFkmnjCmzxLyr0lVGUBvsOvlIpI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Shiro manages to outrun HOMRA with help from a young man named Kurou Yatogami. But Shiro learns that Kurou is after his life as well, and so he uses his wits to flee the scene. Meanwhile, unknown to Shiro, his cat has suddenly turned into a beautiful girl.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vFkmnjCmzxLyr0lVGUBvsOvlIpI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"14467","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"14467","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45799","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"261249","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"18009","synopsis":"After an all-night chase, an exhausted Shiro, Kurou, and Neko decide to make a temporary truce to have breakfast. As they eat, Kurou gives Shiro more background about the seven Kings and the Clans they lead. Kurou then adds that Shiro is suspected of murdering one of HOMRA’s Clansman, which Shiro strongly denies doing.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hfuz1jQpD4mJzGfyS67piozdONr.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"After an all-night chase, an exhausted Shiro, Kurou, and Neko decide to make a temporary truce to have breakfast. As they eat, Kurou gives Shiro more background about the seven Kings and the Clans they lead. Kurou then adds that Shiro is suspected of murdering one of HOMRA’s Clansman, which Shiro strongly denies doing.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hfuz1jQpD4mJzGfyS67piozdONr.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externa